# Only the tool itself is published. Everything else here is local research material:
# reference/ holds third-party sources (Frosty Toolsuite is CC BY-NC-ND), tools/ holds Frosty binaries,
# and research/out + output/ contain data extracted from the game, which must never be redistributed.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/Offline Keep.pyw
!/offlinekeep/
!/packaging/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
/packaging/build/
/packaging/dist/
